{"total": 43.17, "frases": [{"k": "hook", "t0": 0.05, "t1": 2.585, "txt": "That guilty face your dog makes? It's not guilt."}, {"k": "home", "t0": 2.705, "t1": 5.182, "txt": "You come home. There's a chewed slipper on the floor."}, {"k": "face", "t0": 5.262, "t1": 7.251, "txt": "Ears back. Eyes up. Tail low."}, {"k": "knows", "t0": 7.291, "t1": 9.288, "txt": "He looks like he knows exactly what he did."}, {"k": "test", "t0": 9.408, "t1": 13.31, "txt": "In 2009, a scientist at Barnard College put it to the test."}, {"k": "rule", "t0": 13.37, "t1": 16.854, "txt": "Owners told their dogs: don't eat the treat. Then they left the room."}, {"k": "swap", "t0": 16.934, "t1": 21.07, "txt": "Sometimes the dog ate it. Sometimes the scientist secretly took it away."}, {"k": "lie", "t0": 21.15, "t1": 24.366, "txt": "Then some owners were told their dog ate it, even when he didn't."}, {"k": "result", "t0": 24.486, "t1": 28.914, "txt": "The guiltiest faces came from dogs who did nothing wrong, and got scolded anyway."}, {"k": "signal", "t0": 29.054, "t1": 33.722, "txt": "That look isn't a confession. It's an old dog signal that means: please, calm down."}, {"k": "reading", "t0": 33.822, "t1": 36.278, "txt": "He's reading your face, not remembering the slipper."}, {"k": "tip", "t0": 36.398, "t1": 39.9, "txt": "So skip the scolding. Clean it up, and move the slippers out of reach."}, {"k": "cta", "t0": 40.02, "t1": 42.573, "txt": "Send this to someone whose dog makes that face."}], "palavras": [{"w": "That", "t0": 0.08, "t1": 0.339, "k": "hook"}, {"w": "guilty", "t0": 0.339, "t1": 0.684, "k": "hook"}, {"w": "face", "t0": 0.684, "t1": 0.943, "k": "hook"}, {"w": "your", "t0": 0.943, "t1": 1.201, "k": "hook"}, {"w": "dog", "t0": 1.201, "t1": 1.417, "k": "hook"}, {"w": "makes?", "t0": 1.417, "t1": 1.719, "k": "hook"}, {"w": "It's", "t0": 1.719, "t1": 1.978, "k": "hook"}, {"w": "not", "t0": 1.978, "t1": 2.193, "k": "hook"}, {"w": "guilt.", "t0": 2.193, "t1": 2.495, "k": "hook"}, {"w": "Y